/**
 * Synchronously scans all packet-grounded articles and evaluates their evidence-source coverage. Scheduled articles with zero evidence-role rows in article_sources are held (holdReason='no_evidence_sources'); those with at least one source have a stale hold cleared. Returns held/cleared counts immediately. Also kicks off a background source-graph drift repair for published articles (routes body links into article_sources). Returns 409 if a check is already in progress.

 * @summary Check and repair evidence-source coverage for packet-grounded articles
 */
